      "description": "Run large work as a dependency graph of right-sized Claude sessions — plans, per-phase handoffs and a computed ready-set — with a local web console whose autopilot boards each phase, heals what an agent can clear and parks the rest on one named errand. The skill is a lean core with one file per mode (plan, phase-start, phase-finish); the engine prints its own catalogue (phase-graph.sh --help, --explain, --section). Current series: v9.0.",
